flowchart TB
  A["Pending damage since last frame"] --> B["Prepare live layers: continuous or dirty ones add damage"]
  B --> C["Merge with the damage of the last two presented frames"]
  C --> D["Snap to device-pixel rectangles"]
  D --> E["Wait for the frame-latency waitable"]
  E --> F["Re-rasterize stale cached layers"]
  F --> G["For each rectangle: clip, clear, draw the layers that intersect it"]
  G --> H["Present1 with only this frame's changed rectangles"]
  H --> I["Push this frame's damage into the history"]
